File Index

/docker notes.md
Purpose: Docker command reference for building, running, and managing project containers.

/docker-compose.shattered-archive-experimental.yml
Purpose: Experimental Docker Compose stack for Shattered Archive development/testing; also the ONLY place MUD_WRITE_ENABLED=true is set (mud-builder-server service, sharing C:/Projects/merc-mud/2.4/area with the separately-composed game).

/docker-compose.yml
Purpose: This file orchestrates a production deployment of a web and game archive platform using Docker containers and nginx reverse proxy.

/game-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and deploys the game client application with Node.js and Nginx.

/game-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the game server application in a production environment.

/index.html
Purpose: This HTML file serves as a local development setup guide for the ShatteredArchive project.

/mud-builder-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: Digest-pinned multi-stage build of the MUD Builder UI (vite build → nginx static, no VITE_ args — the client calls /api relatively and the edge routes it).

/mud-builder-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: Digest-pinned multi-stage build of the MUD Builder API server (node alpine, pnpm via strict corepack, port 61000); write gate deliberately unset in the image.

/nginx.Dockerfile
Purpose: Nginx Dockerfile configuring SSL, logging, and entrypoint for edge subdomains.

/web-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: Dockerfile for building and serving the web client application with Node.js and Nginx.

/web-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the web server application in a production environment.
